From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kanadaj <kanadaj@royalroad.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:38:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Generate LogsQL instead of LogQL

VictoriaLogs does not serve LogQL. Replace the LogQL query model with a
small LogsQL one: the stream selector stays a { label="value" } filter
(valid LogsQL), the content filter becomes a substring filter
*"text"*, and the severity filter a case-insensitive match on the level
field. Filters the user typed and pipes after the first | are kept as
written. The tenant is no longer part of the query: the tenancy proxy
applies it from the request path.
